    "innovation": "This paper reviews three decades of advances in oceanic iron biogeochemistry, synthesizing discoveries of multiple iron sources, the central role of rapid biological recycling via microbes and organic ligands, and the complex balance between supply and removal processes that determine iron's distribution in the ocean.",
